WEBVTT

00:04:28.934 --> 00:04:34.593
AB: Career decline is a very personal
and personalized phenomenon

00:04:34.617 --> 00:04:39.359
in which your skills
are not what they once were.

00:04:39.383 --> 00:04:41.774
So you might be making
as much, or more, money

00:04:41.798 --> 00:04:43.341
than you ever have before,

00:04:43.365 --> 00:04:47.071
but you know that you are not
at the same level

00:04:47.095 --> 00:04:50.396
of technical adeptness
that you had once attained,

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:54.845
and/or you're not on the trajectory
to attain what you had hoped.

00:04:54.869 --> 00:04:56.669
AG: Maybe you felt your stomach lurch

00:04:56.693 --> 00:04:59.161
when someone younger than you
has a smashing success

00:04:59.185 --> 00:05:00.740
in your field or your workplace.